note Under the References heading, 'promote' makes a flow tour from the selected symbol: the symbol as the root step and the symbols it calls under it, one level deep, all authored by the human, named after the symbol. The reader reaches for it to scaffold a flow from a symbol instead of adding every step by hand. It is the CLI promote command at depth 1. A tour of that name already there is extended with whatever of those symbols it does not pin whole. The tour opens on the Tour tab with its first step selected, and the status gives its name and step count.

